        "title": "Reading passage",
        "contentEn": "Macroeconomic Variables\n\nAkriti Manufacturing Company produces flower vases.\n\nThe cost of production for 100 vase includes rent of rs 10,000, salary for permanent staff of rs 10,000, cost of Labour rs 12,000 and Raw material of rs 18,000. Due to increased demand of vases the company plans to increase\n\nproduction to 200 vases. The variable cost per vase remains rs 300 and the fixed cost does not change."
